:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 1)>>
你驻足在灰白色庄园的侧门外，低沉优雅的大提琴曲正顺着半开的雕花气窗流淌而出。铸铁门楣上的常春藤在晚风里轻轻晃动，廊柱后方的偏厅透出柔和的烛光。守门的仆役刚提着灯笼绕去前院，侧门虚掩着一道窄缝。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<sneakicon>><<link [[潜入侧厅 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">潜入侧厅 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<socialiseicon>><<link [[去回廊搭话 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step3]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去回廊搭话 (0:08)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0) gte 3>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>	<<mpreadicon>><<link [[直奔书房 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">直奔书房 (0:05)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 2)>>
你轻轻推开虚掩的侧门步入偏厅，波斯地毯吞没了靴底的声响。花园回廊下，一位蒙着黑蕾丝面纱的乐手正独自拉着琴弦，脚边的天鹅绒琴盒里露出一角撕碎的晚宴名单。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<socialiseicon>><<link "替乐手拾弓 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你借着烛台阴影掠过屏风，将那半张洒金名单与琴盒夹层里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的打赏金票拢入袖中。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_danube_salon_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循迹深入 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的衣角带倒了屏风边的银质谱架，清脆的撞击声惊动了门外侍从，你在匆忙后退时撞青了手肘。
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[替乐手拾弓 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "替乐手拾弓">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_orchid"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_danube_score"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_danube_score"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
等一曲终了，你走上前替乐手拾起滑落在地的松香琴弓。对方隔着黑色面纱向你微微颔首：「白公馆的主人今晚借着沙龙掩护，正在地下酒窖把一批未登记的古物装箱运往温室兰花厅。」乐手将一张标有书房暗锁刻度的乐谱夹进你掌心，示意你趁管家换班前去书房取纹章。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[潜入书房 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[潜入书房 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "潜入书房">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[探酒窖入口 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step5]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 4)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你顺着乐手指点的回廊暗门溜进二楼书房，胡桃木书桌旁立着一座镶铜古地球仪。底座赤道环上刻着七个古典音名，需要对照乐谱重音依次按压。
<<if $mpClues["grand_danube_score"]>><span class="teal">你对照先前抄下的古典乐谱重音节拍，认准了赤道环上七个音名的按压次序。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step4">
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link "按谱转赤道环 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step4">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['grand_danube_score'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 340 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 340>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($history or 0), ($skulduggery or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 680>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_danube_ledger"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_danube_ledger"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你按降E小调的音程旋动赤道环，底座暗格弹出一枚酒窖黄铜纹章与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的备用金券。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_danube_salon_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你记错了两个升降音阶，地球仪内部的齿轮卡死不动，走廊外逼近的脚步声吓得你满背冷汗。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[按谱转赤道环 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "按谱转赤道环">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 5)>>
你用黄铜纹章旋开地下酒窖的恒温酒架，后方密室里整齐码放着三只填满木丝的红木箱。两名搬运工正背对你清点封条，桌角放着一本私运账册。
<<if $mpClues["grand_danube_ledger"]>><span class="teal">想起书房地球仪里那枚黄铜纹章的齿槽朝向，你一眼看出了酒架锁孔的旋向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link "抄录私运账 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 780>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestDanubeSalon_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你趁搬运工转身钉箱盖的刹那抽走私运账册与一只银爵，顺手摸走桌上约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的押运费。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_danube_salon_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
酒架滑轨发出沉闷的摩擦声，搬运工猛地回头呵斥，你在闪避木箱时小腿磕在铁箍桶沿上。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[抄录私运账 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抄录私运账">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to Math.max(($mpQuestDanubeSalon or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>
当你带着账册重新回到花园回廊时，蒙面乐手已经收拾好大提琴悄然离去。石凳的丝绒坐垫上端端正正放着一枚纯银音符胸针，底下压着一张散发出白麝香气的字条：「多谢你截下那本假账，日后若去峭壁天鹅绒的镜面试衣沙龙，凭这枚胸针便有人照应。」你收起胸针，心中一片笃定。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestDanubeSalon to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestDanubeSalon to 1>>
你从多瑙河街白公馆的雕花侧门闪身而出，将截获的沙龙密会乐谱与名流书信折好收起。二楼的水晶吊灯依然通明，一名夜巡执事在铁门外狐疑地打量了你一眼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-resolve">
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 280>><<mpwatchicon>><<link "绕过夜巡 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-danube-salon-resolve">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 900>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestDanubeSalon_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你神色泰然地亮出胸前的纯银音符胸针，执事立刻躬身行礼并递上约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的车马津贴。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_danube_salon_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你在执事审视的目光下步伐微乱，只得压低帽檐快步混入梧桐树影之中。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Danube Salon Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[绕过夜巡 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "绕过夜巡">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 1)>>
你凑近警局后巷的铁栅窗往里打量，昏暗的旧证物室角落堆放着几只落满灰尘、贴着十年前封条的木箱。铁栅窗下方的通风百叶栓已经锈蚀松动，巷口路灯把拉长的铁栏阴影投在潮湿的砖墙上。你可以试着撬开百叶栓，或者先向巡夜的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>打听换岗规律。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<sneakicon>><<link [[挑开百叶栓 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">挑开百叶栓 (0:08)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[问林恩换岗 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问林恩换岗 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问林恩换岗 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0) gte 3>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>	<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻零七卷宗 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">翻零七卷宗 (0:08)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 2)>>
你蹲在后巷排水槽边，将薄铁片探入通风百叶窗的锈蚀插销。窗内便是半地下的旧证物室，铁架上摆满了未归档的罚没钱袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:08)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "拨开通风窗销 (0:05)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
你巧劲一拨便挑开插销，无声滑入证物室铁架后方，顺手从散落的罚没袋里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的旧钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_barb_evidence_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<link [[找林恩请教 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step3]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找林恩请教 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[打开零七箱 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
生锈的百叶窗页刮破了你的手背，刺耳的金属摩擦声引来值班室里的咳嗽声，你只得屏息缩在墙角。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[拨开通风窗销 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨开通风窗销">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_barb_case07"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_barb_case07"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
缠着护腕绷带的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>正靠在后巷砖墙边抽烟，见你从铁栅窗边退回来，便递给你一枚扁平的铜垫片。「证物室的值班警长每晚整点都会去前面喝咖啡。」<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>压低声音指了指窗内角落，「编号『雾月-07』的那只箱子连着黑铁货运站三号装甲货车的旧案，撬的时候垫上这片铜皮就不会留印子。」
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查零七卷宗 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step4]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查零七卷宗 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查零七卷宗">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[摸底层证物 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step5]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[摸底层证物 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸底层证物">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你借着铁栅窗漏进的微光掀开『雾月-07』木箱，陈年樟脑丸的气味扑面而来。箱内整整齐齐码着一叠被强行撤案的失踪笔录与港口汇票存根。
<<if $mpClues["grand_barb_case07"]>><span class="teal">对照值班室旧档里记下的『雾月-07』编号，你径直在铁架角落找到了那只木箱。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[翻窗回街 (0:08)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step4">
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬开证物袋 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step4">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['grand_barb_case07'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 320 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($english or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_pier"] to 1>>
你迅速理清笔录里的暗语，查明当年扣押的货船都停靠在雾角栈桥，并从存根信封里找出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的不记名本票。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_barb_evidence_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
发霉的纸页字迹模糊难辨，昏暗的光线看得你眼眶酸胀，只得先把卷宗塞回原处。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开证物袋 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开证物袋">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
木箱最底层压着一只打着红漆铅封的帆布证物袋，袋口缠着防拆钢丝。走廊外忽然传来值班警员拿着钥匙串巡查的脚步声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[翻窗撤离 (0:08)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "剪钢丝取证物 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_barb_key"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_barb_key"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestBarbEvidence_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你用铜垫片无声挑开铅封，摸出孤儿院账册编号铜匙与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的封存赃款。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_barb_evidence_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
防拆钢丝扎破了你的拇指，警员的手电光扫过门缝，你狼狈地滚进铁架底下才没被抓个正着。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[剪钢丝取证物 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "剪钢丝取证物">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to Math.max(($mpQuestBarbEvidence or 0), 6)>>
你屏住呼吸蹲在木箱前，用打火机微弱的火苗烤软封条背面的陈年火漆，将十年前的纸封严丝合缝地重新按回箱沿。你又抓起铁架角落的一撮浮灰均匀吹在箱盖表面，彻底掩去了指印。听着门外巡警走远的脚步声，你紧绷的心弦终于松了开来。
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_barb_key"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前拓下的证物室铜匙齿痕，你把撬动过的锁簧拨回了原初的角度。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:08)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[翻窗回后巷 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBarbEvidence to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestBarbEvidence to 1>>
你将倒钩街证物室铁栅窗的插销原样扣回，把抽出的旧案封条与受贿底单贴身藏好。巷口正好有一辆巡逻警车闪着顶灯拐进来，你需要立刻翻上后巷高墙脱身。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-resolve">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<runicon>><<link "翻过后巷高墙 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-barb-evidence-resolve">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 340>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1100>><<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestBarbEvidence_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你蹬住排水管干净利落地翻过砖墙，将底单副本卖给暗桩换得约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的线报赏金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_barb_evidence_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你翻墙时靴跟滑脱摔在垃圾桶旁，膝盖磕出一片淤青，好不容易才钻进窄巷甩开警车。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Barb Evidence Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<runicon>><<link [[翻过后巷高墙 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "翻过后巷高墙">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 1)>>
你沿着峭壁边缘潮湿的石阶向上攀登，那一串带着海藻碎屑的湿脚印一直延伸到废弃雾角塔的铁门前。铁门上的铜挂锁已经被撬开虚掩着，门缝里传出螺旋石梯特有的空洞风鸣。海雾在百尺峭壁下方翻涌，你可以推门上塔，或者先去值班室看看火炉余温。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[走下石阶 (0:03)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀上螺旋梯 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">攀上螺旋梯 (0:12)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<investigateicon>><<link [[进入值班室 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step3]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">进入值班室 (0:12)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0) gte 3>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>	<<sneakicon>><<link [[直登透镜室 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step4]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">直登透镜室 (0:12)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 2)>>
你推开沉重的生铁门走入塔内，盘旋而上的石梯好几级已经崩裂，海风顺着窄长的瞭望风孔灌进来发出呜咽声。风孔内侧的石龛里卡着一只油布钱袋。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:12)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step2">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<runicon>><<link "跨上中层平台 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 320 or ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你扣住石壁上的铁抓环跨过断阶，稳稳探手取出那只油布袋，里面装着约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的旧海港银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_cliff_lighthouse_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
狂风猛地吹迷了你的眼睛，你一脚踩在松动的碎石上滑倒，手掌在粗糙的岩壁上擦破了皮。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<runicon>><<link [[跨上中层平台 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "跨上中层平台">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_cliff_signal"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_cliff_signal"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
在塔楼中层的守塔人值班室里，铸铁火炉里的木炭灰烬尚存一丝余温，隔绝了外海的湿冷寒气。木桌上摊开着一张标注着近海暗流与灯语信号的航海草图，详细画出了从外海雾角灯塔岛守塔人旧居与这座废塔对发闪光暗号的角度。你将草图上的三组闪光频率默记于心，身体也暖和了不少。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:12)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查验透镜 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查验透镜 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查验透镜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[摸灯座暗格 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[摸灯座暗格 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸灯座暗格">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你顺着螺旋梯爬上塔顶灯室，高处的海风吹得黄铜窗框嗡嗡作响。巨大的环形菲涅尔透镜后方藏着一只铜制信号匣，里面插着红蓝绿三色滤光片与折算表。
<<if $mpClues["grand_cliff_signal"]>><span class="teal">你想起岩石暗哨里记下的三色灯语次序，一眼认出了信号匣里滤光片的插槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:12)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬开灯座暗格 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($science or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_cliff_lens"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_cliff_lens"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你按折射率拼合三色滤光片，破译出走私船在海蚀回音廊接头的时刻，并从匣底摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的联络津贴。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_cliff_lighthouse_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
复杂的棱镜折射角让你算错了潮汐时间，冰冷的穿堂风吹得你太阳穴突突直跳。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开灯座暗格 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开灯座暗格">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 5)>>
塔顶灯室的铸铁旋转底座下方有一格用铅条封死的检修仓，仓门缝隙里渗出淡淡的机油味。里面塞着走私瞭望手来不及带走的防水货包与单筒望远镜。
<<if $mpClues["grand_cliff_lens"]>><span class="teal">对照先前在菲涅尔透镜后记下的折射偏角，你摸准了底座检修仓的铅封活扣。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:12)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "取出信号图 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCliffLighthouse_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你避开配重齿轮撬开铅封仓门，将封存暗货与望远镜筒里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的金镑尽数收入囊中。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_cliff_lighthouse_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势追查 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step6]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
沉重的配重铅块忽然下滑，擦伤了你的手腕，震耳的哐当声在塔筒内久久回荡。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[取出信号图 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取出信号图">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to Math.max(($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0), 6)>>
你刚走下雾角塔外侧的石阶，便看见<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>正支着木画架在峭壁栏杆边描摹海雾。见你怀里揣着鼓鼓囊囊的棱镜袋，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>不动声色地展开一条宽大的羊绒披肩搭在你肩上。「刚才有两名港务巡警往这边看，站到我画架后面当会儿模特吧，」<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>冲你眨了眨眼，几笔便把你的剪影画进了雾海画卷里。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[趁雾撤离 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestCliffLighthouse to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestCliffLighthouse to 1>>
你走下峭壁旧雾角塔的螺旋石阶，将守塔人留下的折射棱镜与海雾信号图收进贴身行囊。海风裹挟着咸湿的雾气扑面而来，远海走私船的灯语规律已尽在你的掌握之中。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回峭壁街 (0:02)|Cliff Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "cliff">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-resolve">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<walkicon>><<link "走碎石坡返回 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-cliff-lighthouse-resolve">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestCliffLighthouse_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你稳步穿过湿滑的崖边栈道，将多余的滤光铜件交予收藏商兑得约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的酬金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_cliff_lighthouse_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
陡峭的崖壁让你走得双腿发软，好不容易回到街面时已是气喘吁吁。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Cliff Lighthouse Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[走碎石坡返回 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "走碎石坡返回">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 1)>>
你走到游戏厅最里侧那台黑屏的旧街机旁，四周嘈杂的电子音效掩盖了机身背后传来的轻微电流嗡鸣。木质机箱底部与地板瓷砖之间留着一道新鲜的弧形刮痕，投币口内侧似乎装有感应弹簧。你可以假装投币按压暗槽，或者先观察一下周围玩家与店员的动向。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[按压投币口 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[找常客聊聊 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0) gte 3>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[下夹层查软盘 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 2)>>
你假装弯腰捡游戏币俯下身，手指探进黑屏街机侧面的退币暗槽。里面并排藏着三枚微动开关，需要避开漏电铜线依次拨开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "拨微动开关 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
机箱底座应声滑开半尺，露出通往地下夹层的铁梯，你顺手从储币盒里捞出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的钞票。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_arcade_basement_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
裸露的电容打出一串电火花，麻得你指尖一颤，额头重重磕在机箱塑料挡板上。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[拨微动开关 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨微动开关">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_corridor"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_arcade_floppy"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_arcade_floppy"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
走下狭窄的铁梯，地下夹层是一间弥漫着松香焊锡味的改装工坊。一名戴着护目镜的年轻技师正低头焊接着一块主板，头也不抬地把你当成了来取货的中间人。他顺手将一张贴着标签的五寸软盘推到桌边：「地下钱庄的对账口令都在盘里，另外后面那扇铸铁风门直通机括城的青铜齿轮回廊，走的时候别忘了关电闸。」
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[读取软盘 (0:08)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step4]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[读取软盘 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "读取软盘">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查上锁抽屉 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查上锁抽屉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查上锁抽屉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 4)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你点亮工作台上的绿屏显示器，把那张五寸软盘推入驱动器。屏幕上跳出一排十六进制校验码，需要换算成对应的十进制校验位才能打开账本目录。
<<if $mpClues["grand_arcade_floppy"]>><span class="teal">你按先前从机箱背板抄下的跳线排布，很快算出了绿屏上的十六进制校验位。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "导出软盘 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($maths or 0) gte 320 or ($science or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($maths or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_arcade_cipher"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_arcade_cipher"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你飞快敲入校验数字，顺利调出星鱼街钱庄的交接暗语，并转出账户里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的测试彩金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_arcade_basement_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
闪烁的绿色字符看得你头晕目眩，连续三次输错校验码后驱动器自动锁死退出。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[导出软盘 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "导出软盘">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 5)>>
工作台最底层的钢制抽屉挂着一把精巧的磁性暗锁，锁孔周围没有任何撬痕。里面存放着一盒早期发行的纯银街机纪念币与全套锁芯改装探针。
<<if $mpClues["grand_arcade_cipher"]>><span class="teal">凭着刚从软盘目录里读出的磁锁编号，你避开了抽屉锁孔外侧的防撬暗销。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "消磁开暗锁 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestArcadeBasement_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你用桌上的消磁线圈贴住锁孔拉开抽屉，收好纯银纪念币盒与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的备用现钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_arcade_basement_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循迹深入 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
抽屉边缘的防盗簧片猛地弹起夹伤了你的手指，刺耳的电流啸叫声让你慌忙拔掉电源。
<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[消磁开暗锁 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "消磁开暗锁">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to Math.max(($mpQuestArcadeBasement or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
在爬上铁梯前，你顺手关掉了改装工坊的备用稳压器，发现排风管内壁贴着一张手绘的地下管网剖面图。图上用荧光笔标出了一条从机括城通往地下停摆天文台的干爽通道。你将图纸折好塞进内袋，顺着铁梯悄无声息地爬回游戏厅地面。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[混入人群 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[推回街机 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Arcade Basement Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestArcadeBasement to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestArcadeBasement to 1>>
你把星鱼街游戏厅最里侧那台黑屏街机推回墙角，用导线将暗门电磁锁恢复为待机状态。外面的霓虹灯依旧闪烁不停，没有一名玩家察觉到你刚从地底密室归来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:08)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-arcade-basement-resolve">
