:: MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHospitalWing to Math.max(($mpQuestHospitalWing or 0), 1)>>
你轻轻推开医院旧翼走廊尽头的磨砂玻璃门，废弃的病区走廊空无一人，只有最里侧的药剂室传来规律的冷凝水滴声。头顶的应急灯管泛着冷白微光，空气里混杂着陈年来苏水与干枯草药的气味。你可以放轻脚步走进旧药剂室，或者先和走廊外的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>打听情况。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<walkicon>><<link [[走进药剂室 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">走进药剂室 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[问诺艾尔 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问诺艾尔 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问诺艾尔 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>

:: MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHospitalWing to Math.max(($mpQuestHospitalWing or 0), 2)>>
你放轻脚步走进旧药剂室，实验台上的微型酒精灯还跳动着幽蓝火苗。玻璃冷凝管正将淡紫色的提纯液一滴滴汇入锥形瓶，旁边摊开着一本实验手记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-hospital-wing-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "收集提纯液 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-hospital-wing-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($science or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你熟练地用塞子封好提纯液，并从实验服口袋里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的药材采购经费。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_hospital_wing_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpherbicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>><<link [[问草药配比 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问草药配比 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找备用铜匙 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
你不小心碰歪了酒精灯座，挥发的药雾熏得你头重脚轻，只能慌忙退到窗边透气。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[收集提纯液 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "收集提纯液">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHospitalWing to Math.max(($mpQuestHospitalWing or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_specimen"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_hospital_formula"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_hospital_formula"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你在旧翼侧廊遇到了前来取蒸馏器皿的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>，把抄下的配比单递给对方过目。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>仔细嗅了嗅纸页上的清香，轻声告诉你：「这种高纯度宁神剂需要用到多瑙河温室庄园夜光标本廊培育的银丝花蕊，药剂柜玻璃格后面就挂着开启底层保险抽屉的备用铜匙。」<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet>>诺艾尔<<else>>标本学徒<</if>>还贴心地递给你一枚薄荷糖提神。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link [[开保险屉 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[开保险屉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "开保险屉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<mpsneakicon>><<link [[查冷藏室 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<mpsneakicon>><<link [[查冷藏室 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查冷藏室">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>

:: MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHospitalWing to Math.max(($mpQuestHospitalWing or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你探手从药剂柜玻璃格后方摸出那串冰凉的备用铜匙，蹲下身将其插入最底层的铸铁保险抽屉锁孔。锁芯深处带着一道紧密的防盗卡簧，需要放轻手劲慢慢旋转。
<<if $mpClues["grand_hospital_formula"]>><span class="teal">你对照旧病历夹层里那行退色配比，认出了药剂柜玻璃格后藏钥匙的暗槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
