	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_hospital_order"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_hospital_order"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你稳稳拉开抽屉，取出与温室地下酿造室往来的采购协议，以及信封里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的秘密定金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_hospital_wing_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
锁簧弹回震痛了你的指关节，玻璃柜门发出的晃动声让你心惊肉跳。
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Hospital Wing Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[开保险抽屉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "开保险抽屉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
