<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestHospitalWing to Math.max(($mpQuestHospitalWing or 0), 5)>>
旧药剂室内侧的恒温冷库里散发着丝丝凉气，铁架上存放着整匣贴有封条的高纯度宁神饮。走廊磨砂窗外忽然亮起夜间巡查员晃动的手电光柱。
<<if $mpClues["grand_hospital_order"]>><span class="teal">想起保险抽屉提货单上写明的夜巡换岗钟点，你提前贴进了冷库铁架的阴影。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:03)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
