<<set $mpQuestSchoolBell to Math.max(($mpQuestSchoolBell or 0), 2)>>
在钟塔半层的平台处，通往报时大钟机芯室的铁栅门被一把四轮字码铜锁拦住。门框青砖上刻着一行罗马数字与校徽纪年。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-school-bell-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "按数字拨锁 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-school-bell-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($maths or 0) gte 320>>
