:: MP Grand Quest School Bell Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestSchoolBell to Math.max(($mpQuestSchoolBell or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
机芯室内光线幽暗，两米高的黄铜报时大钟静静悬在粗壮的橡木横梁下。大钟内壁镌刻着一幅微缩的城镇星象俯瞰图，将学园、神殿与雾角灯塔连成正三角形。
<<if $mpClues["grand_bell_triangle"]>><span class="teal">你对照钟楼阶梯壁龛里拓下的三角星图，看清了大钟内壁三条刻线的交汇点。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-school-bell-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mptranslateicon>><<link "拓印星轨铭文 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-school-bell-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($science or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_bell_vernier"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_bell_vernier"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你准确拓下正三角星轨坐标与折光穹顶室的校准刻度，并在钟锤底座下摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_school_bell_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest School Bell Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
钟体内部的弧面让拓纸频频移位，报时齿轮忽然转动发出的闷响震得你耳膜嗡嗡作响。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest School Bell Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
