:: MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestPoolDrain to Math.max(($mpQuestPoolDrain or 0), 4)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
检修暗门后方是一座保存完好的古典罗马式地下温水浴池，四周立着斑驳的石柱。清澈的温泉水从青铜兽首水口中源源涌出，池底白沙间闪烁着银币的光泽。
<<if $mpClues["grand_pool_valve"]>><span class="teal">你按排水口铁牌上标明的回水方向，认出了古浴池石柱后方的泄压主阀。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校泳池 (0:03)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-step4">
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 280>><<swimicon>><<link "探兽首水口 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-step4">>
<<if (($swimmingskill or 0) + ($mpClues['grand_pool_valve'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($swimmingskill or 0), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_pool_roman"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_pool_roman"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你潜入温润的泉水中抄下兽首铭文，并从池底白沙间捞起约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古代浴场银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_pool_drain_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
温热的泉水让你有些气短，你在滑腻的汉白玉池阶上扑了个空，呛了一小口水。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<swimicon>><<link [[探兽首水口 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "探兽首水口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestPoolDrain to Math.max(($mpQuestPoolDrain or 0), 5)>>
在青铜兽首水口正下方的池壁凹槽里，卡着一只用铅蜡封口的防水银饰盒。涌动的温热泉水暗流不断冲击着石龛边缘，水波晃动间隐约可见盒盖上的家族纹章。
<<if $mpClues["grand_pool_roman"]>><span class="teal">借着方才放缓泉眼水流的空档，池壁凹槽里那只铅蜡银饰盒的卡扣清晰可见。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校泳池 (0:03)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<bedicon "zzz">><<link "泡温泉休整 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 340>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 340>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($swimmingskill or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestPoolDrain_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你顶着泉涌稳稳抠出那只防水银饰盒，里面存着香精油与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古金币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_pool_drain_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
湍急的泉眼暗流把你推向石壁，肩膀撞在青铜兽角上隐隐作痛，你只得先浮出水面换气。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[泡温泉休整 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "泡温泉休整">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestPoolDrain to Math.max(($mpQuestPoolDrain or 0), 6)>>
你坐在地下浴池温润的汉白玉石阶上，让清澈温暖的泉水漫过肩头。带着淡淡硫磺与香草气息的蒸汽在穹顶下袅袅盘旋，将你肌肉里的酸痛与精神上的紧绷感一寸寸涤荡干净。你用干毛巾擦干水迹，将防水银饰盒装进随身包里，把这处隐秘的地下温泉暗记于心。
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[关阀返回更衣廊 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestPoolDrain to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestPoolDrain to 1>>
你拧紧泳池器材室后方的温水循环铜阀，趁着白色水雾尚未散尽，带着防水密封筒退回更衣廊。外面正好有游泳队的学生经过器材室门口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学校泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-resolve">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "趁雾返回更衣廊 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-pool-drain-resolve">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestPoolDrain_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你神态自然地拎着泳衣袋走出器材室，将多余的古浴场银币兑出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的现钱。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_pool_drain_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你不小心碰倒了门边的浮板架，在众人的注视下匆忙低头快步离开。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Pool Drain Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[趁雾返回更衣廊 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "趁雾返回更衣廊">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 1)>>
你掀开三号干船坞沉重的防雨帆布一角钻了进去，船坞内停泊着一艘通体漆成墨黑色的双桅帆船，桅杆上没有悬挂任何旗帜。船舷边的木跳板刚被人用淡水冲刷过，船长室的圆形舷窗内透出微弱的烛光。你可以顺着木跳板悄悄登上甲板，或者先在船坞廊柱后找<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>打听这艘黑船的底细。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<sneakicon>><<link [[走跳板上船 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">走跳板上船 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[问维斯 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问维斯 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问维斯 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0) gte 3>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>	<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[进船长室查账 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">进船长室查账 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 2)>>
你弓着腰踏上搭在船舷边的松木跳板，跳板下方拉着一根连向报警铜铃的细麻线。船头锚链舱的铁盖半开着，里面放着水手值夜的零钱匣。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "潜入锚链舱 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 330>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
你轻巧地跨过报警麻线翻上甲板，从锚链舱零钱匣里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的海港银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_mer_drydock_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<link [[找维斯对船号 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找维斯对船号 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[进入船长室 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的靴尖勾到了麻线，铜铃发出一声轻响，你在急忙缩身躲进帆布堆时磕痛了膝盖。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[潜入锚链舱 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "潜入锚链舱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_drydock_manifest"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_drydock_manifest"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
船坞外侧的起重机阴影下，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>正靠着铁柱按灭烟头。「这艘无旗双桅船每隔半月就会把外海私货卸进黑铁货运站的地下走私月台。」<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>从大衣口袋里摸出一把开口扳手递给你，「船长室床铺底下的暗舱是用左旋螺栓锁住的，趁船长去酒馆喝酒，动作快一点。」
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查分流清单 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step4]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查分流清单 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查分流清单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[扳开底舱 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step5]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[扳开底舱 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "扳开底舱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你推门闪进弥漫着朗姆酒与松木味的船长室，壁灯里的鲸油烛火轻轻摇曳。桌上的黄铜航海罗盘正受桌下磁铁牵引微微偏转，底座下压着一份走私货物分流清单。
<<if $mpClues["grand_drydock_manifest"]>><span class="teal">你对照船坞龙骨旁抄下的吃水吨位，一眼识破了船长室罗盘底座下的夹层。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mprepairicon>><<link "校准罗盘 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 340>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($maths or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($maths or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>>
你算出清单上的吨位差额藏在断桅沉船滩，并从海图抽屉里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的押船银票。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_mer_drydock_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
船身随着船坞底水微微摇晃，杂乱的航海缩写看得你眼花缭乱，半天没能对上账目。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[校准罗盘 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "校准罗盘">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你蹲在船长室狭窄的木床铺前，用扳手卡住床板下方的四颗左旋黄铜螺栓。暗舱里并排放着一只铅封货箱与一枚刻有海怪纹章的纯银六分仪。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:03)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mpcarryicon>><<link "卸螺栓取匣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($physique or 0) gte 9500>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_drydock_sextant"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_drydock_sextant"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestMerDrydock_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你一鼓作气卸下螺栓提出暗舱货箱，收起纯银六分仪与箱内约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的走私金镑。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_mer_drydock_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
扳手突然打滑撞在铁船肋上，震得你虎口生疼，甲板上方顿时传来守夜水手的脚步声。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mpcarryicon>><<link [[卸螺栓取匣 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "卸螺栓取匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to Math.max(($mpQuestMerDrydock or 0), 6)>>
你将床板下的暗舱盖严丝合缝地重新扣好，又把桌上的黄铜罗盘拨回原本的磁偏角位置。你透过圆形舷窗往外看去，确认甲板上的守夜水手已经转去船尾抽烟。随后你轻轻掩上船长室木门，顺着潮湿的木跳板悄然滑回干船坞地面，夜色与浓雾将你的身形完美藏匿。
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_drydock_sextant"]>><span class="teal">按先前用六分仪测出的磁偏角度数，你将罗盘指针分毫不差地拨回了原位。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[放下防雨帆布 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMerDrydock to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestMerDrydock to 1>>
你放平三号干船坞外围的防雨帆布，将从无旗双桅船暗舱里起出的航海密匣贴身收好。船坞大门外的巡夜提灯正摇晃着逼近。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回梅尔街 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-resolve">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "拉帆布离开 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-mer-drydock-resolve">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 340>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 340>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestMerDrydock_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你贴着龙门吊阴影闪出船坞，将分流航线卖给港口线人换得约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的赏银。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_mer_drydock_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
船坞守夜人的猎犬冲着帆布狂吠起来，你只得压低身子快步跑出港区。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Mer Drydock Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[拉帆布离开 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拉帆布离开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestElkWorkshop to Math.max(($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0), 1)>>
你走到成人店后巷尽头，按照特定节奏敲了三下地下工坊的铁门，门后的插销滑开，一股皮革与金属抛光膏的气息扑面而来。工坊内部摆满了精巧的黄铜锁具、丝绒束缚带与发条模型，工作台前却不见工匠的身影。你可以上前查看工作台上的锁具样品，或者先向<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>请教精密簧片的结构。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:03)|Elk Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查验锁芯 (0:10)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step2]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问塞拉 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问塞拉 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0) gte 3>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[取逃生图 (0:10)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step4]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestElkWorkshop to Math.max(($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0), 2)>>
你走近地下工坊宽大的胡桃木工作台，台灯将金属零件照得纤毫毕现。深色绒布上摆着三把拆了一半的双簧黄铜挂锁与一叠客户预付的手工定金。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:10)|Elk Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-elk-workshop-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "拼合锁芯 (0:05)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-elk-workshop-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你用尖嘴钳拨正错位的锁簧将其组装复原，顺手收起绒布下约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的定金零钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_elk_workshop_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问塞拉图纸 (0:10)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step3]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 10>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问塞拉图纸 (0:10)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<link [[研读图纸 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
紧绷的发条簧片突然弹开，锋利的铜边划破了你的食指，吓得你连忙放下钳子。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[拼合锁芯 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拼合锁芯">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
