:: MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestElkWorkshop to Math.max(($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
