	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Elk Workshop Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[带锁芯离开 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "带锁芯离开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 1)>>
你趁着酒馆后院无人注意，用力拉起巨型橡木酒桶下方的生锈铁环，地面活板门向上掀起，露出一段带有浓郁麦芽酒香的石阶。前厅吧台传来酒客划拳的喧哗声，石阶下方点着昏暗的壁灯。你可以顺着石阶走下深层酒窖，或者先找后院歇脚的酒保打听空心酒桶的记号。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[下石阶敲酒桶 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[请酒保喝一杯 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step3]]>><<money -200>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请酒保喝一杯 (0:05)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0) gte 3>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[直入议事室 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 2)>>
顺着石阶走下深层酒窖，两侧排列着数十只一人高的陈年橡木桶。你用指节逐一叩击桶壁，最里侧的一只大桶传出空心的回音，侧面的木塞可以左右扳动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "敲桶找暗门 (0:05)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你顺时针拧动木塞旋开桶门，并在桶座暗槽里摸出酒客藏匿的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 酒资。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_harvest_cellar_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[找酒保套话 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step3]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[进入议事室 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
木塞机关卡得极紧，你用力过猛扭伤了手腕，酒桶铁箍还刮破了你的袖口。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[敲桶找暗门 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "敲桶找暗门">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_harvest_pact"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_harvest_pact"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
后院台阶上坐着一名擦酒杯的老酒保，你走过去帮他把空木箱叠好。老酒保吐出一口烟雾，朝活板门方向努了努嘴：「酒桶后面那间议事室是丰收街帮派和私酒商分账的地方，他们最高级的秘酿都是从多瑙河温室庄园的地下酿造室直接运来的。」老酒保提醒你圆桌抽屉底下有个双层夹板。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查分成契约 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step4]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查分成契约 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查分成契约">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查圆桌暗屉 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step5]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查圆桌暗屉 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查圆桌暗屉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
空心酒桶后方是一间点着煤气灯的地下议事室，空气里飘着浓烈的雪茄烟味。橡木圆桌上散落着帮派与港区私酒商的分成契约，旁边放着一只未上锁的鹿皮钱袋。
<<if $mpClues["grand_harvest_pact"]>><span class="teal">凭着酒桶底箍上摸到的空心记号，你认出了议事室圆桌下暗藏的机关拉环。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link "收起分账草稿 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($maths or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($maths or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1250>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 950>><<else>><<set _reward to 680>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>
你按账目比例抽走不会引人起疑的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 散钞，并记下送往天鹅绒露台观海雅座的酒单。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_harvest_cellar_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
复杂的黑帮分成暗码看得你头疼，头顶地板传来的沉重脚步声让你不敢久留。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[收起分账草稿 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "收起分账草稿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
圆桌主位下方的暗抽屉设有精巧的倒钩暗簧，锁眼隐蔽在雕花木纹之间。夹层里藏着一瓶封存五十年的绝版琥珀威士忌、一枚帮派铜戒与黑市定金。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "避暗簧拉抽屉 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_harvest_cask"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_harvest_cask"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestHarvestCellar_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你按住倒钩滑出暗屉，将绝版名酒、铜戒与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的定金一并收入怀中。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_harvest_cellar_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
倒钩暗簧弹起划伤了你的手腕，石阶上方传来帮派打手下楼的说话声，吓得你急忙缩回桶后。
<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[避暗簧拉抽屉 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "避暗簧拉抽屉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to Math.max(($mpQuestHarvestCellar or 0), 6)>>
你将圆桌上的契约纸张按原来的折痕摆好，退回深层酒窖通道，轻轻拉上那扇伪装成陈年橡木桶的暗门。随着木塞机关咔哒一声归位，整排橡木桶看起来毫无二致。你用衣袖擦去木塞上的指印，顺着带有麦芽香气石阶悄然向上爬去，呼吸平稳而轻松。
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_harvest_cask"]>><span class="teal">对照先前记下的分成契约折痕与木塞刻度，你将整排橡木桶恢复得毫无破绽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[撒草掩活板门 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 5>><</link>>

