<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestHarvestCellar to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestHarvestCellar to 1>>
你将丰收街酒馆后院橡木桶下的地窖铁环放回凹槽，顺手撒上一层干草掩去新翻动的痕迹。后门风灯下正好有两名私酒贩子低声交谈着经过巷口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回丰收街 (0:08)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-resolve">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "撒草掩迹离开 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-harvest-cellar-resolve">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestHarvestCellar_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你亮出帮派铜戒将那瓶绝版威士忌高价脱手，净赚约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 后潇洒离去。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_harvest_cellar_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
后院醉客吵嚷着朝这边走来，你只好压低头快步从侧门溜出后院。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Harvest Cellar Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[撒草掩迹离开 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撒草掩迹离开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 1)>>
你拨开住宅区小巷两道砖墙夹缝间的旧帆布，里面是一处用木托盘和厚毛毯搭建起来的干燥避风棚。角落的铁罐里存着半罐防潮火柴与压缩饼干，显然是早年孤儿院流浪儿留下的秘密据点。你可以加固松脱的防风帆布，或者翻看毛毯下方砖缝里的铅笔互助笔记。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[加固帆布 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[翻看笔记 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">翻看笔记 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0) gte 3>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[探排水管 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 2)>>
你弯腰钻进干燥温暖的避风棚内，外面的穿堂冷风顿时被挡在帆布之外。你将松脱的防风拉绳重新系在墙砖铁钩上，又动手清理木托盘下方的积灰。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step2">
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬开旧木箱 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>>
	<<set _sk to ($housekeeping or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 780>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
你把避风棚收拾得整洁牢固，并从木托盘凹槽里扫出前人留下的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 应急硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_alley_shelter_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpreadicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[共读互助笔记 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">共读互助笔记 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>	<<investigateicon>><<link [[摸排水管 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[摸排水管 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸排水管">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
狭窄的砖墙夹缝让你施展不开，扬起的灰尘呛得你连连咳嗽，腰背也酸痛不已。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开旧木箱 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开旧木箱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_shelter_map"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_shelter_map"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>顺着小巷找了过来，钻进避风棚坐在你身边的厚毛毯上。你们一起翻开砖缝里那本用铅笔写的互助笔记，上面不仅画着住宅区所有翻墙捷径，还标出了一条通往黑铁货运站废弃调车场的隐秘狗洞。「以前大孩子们被贝利罚关禁闭时，就会躲到这里来，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>轻轻靠着你的肩膀，眼里满是安心。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查排水管 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[查排水管 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查排水管">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[拆铁盒封蜡 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
顺着互助笔记最后一页的铅笔箭头，你小心翼翼地踩上垫高的木托盘。你伸手探入头顶铸铁排水管的干燥空腔，指尖很快触到了一只用油纸层层包裹的小铁盒。
<<if $mpClues["grand_shelter_map"]>><span class="teal">你顺着墙砖缝隙里摸到的互助会粉笔箭头，准确找出了头顶排水管的干燥空腔。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<runicon>><<link "探水管暗格 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>
你稳稳夹出小铁盒，发现油纸内侧画着地下机括城档案馆密库的通风口位置，盒底还垫着约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的旧钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_alley_shelter_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循迹深入 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
木托盘突然倾斜，你的手肘擦在粗糙的红砖墙面上，火辣辣地生疼。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<runicon>><<link [[探水管暗格 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "探水管暗格">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
那只小铁盒表面涂着防锈黑漆，盒口设有一道简易的铁丝扭簧锁。里面保存着早年院童积攒的应急资金与一枚磨得发亮的孤儿院建院旧铜章。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<bedicon "zzz">><<link "毯上小憩 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 340>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1350>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1020>><<else>><<set _reward to 720>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_shelter_badge"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_shelter_badge"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestAlleyShelter_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你顺着扭簧方向挑开盒盖，收好旧铜章与里面约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的互助储蓄。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_alley_shelter_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
生锈的铁丝扭簧崩断划破了你的指腹，巷外忽然传来野狗的吠叫声，让你心头一紧。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[毯上小憩 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "毯上小憩">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to Math.max(($mpQuestAlleyShelter or 0), 6)>>
你窝在避风棚干燥松软的厚毛毯上歇息片刻，借着微光将互助笔记上标注的翻墙捷径与躲避追捕的死角全部背熟。两道高墙挡住了外面的冷风，前人留下的铁罐与字迹让你在这座冷漠的小镇里感受到了一丝难得的暖意。你将笔记重新放回砖缝，给后来的院童留下一包火柴。
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -4>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_shelter_badge"]>><span class="teal">摩挲着油纸包里那枚互助会旧铜章，你将笔记上的翻墙捷径逐一印入脑海。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[系帆布离开 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestAlleyShelter to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestAlleyShelter to 1>>
你替住宅区砖墙夹缝里的避风棚重新系紧防风帆布，将前人留在铁皮盒里的求生笔记与古币收好。巷口正好有两名不良少年晃悠过来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回住宅区小巷 (0:08)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-resolve">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "返回巷口 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-alley-shelter-resolve">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1100>><<else>><<set _reward to 820>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestAlleyShelter_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你按刚记熟的翻墙捷径一步跃上矮墙绕到他们身后，顺手捡走他们藏在墙头的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 零钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_alley_shelter_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你为了不暴露避风棚位置，只得绕远路穿过泥泞的窄巷才甩开他们。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Alley Shelter Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[返回巷口 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "返回巷口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 1)>>
你从工业区小巷潜入停工的旧铸造厂侧门，高耸的铁皮穹顶下，巨大的炼铁炉虽然早已废弃，炉膛底部却仍亮着一点暗红的炭火。操作台边的砂模槽里残留着刚浇铸成型不久的黄铜齿轮毛坯，地面上散落着新刮下的铜屑。你可以上前检查砂模槽，或者顺着铜屑上二楼模具室看看。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:08)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查齿轮毛坯 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[上二楼模具室 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestFoundry or 0) gte 3>>
	<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬铁皮柜 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 2)>>
你走近炼铁炉宽大的铸铁操作台，拿起长柄火钳翻开尚带余温的细密型砂槽。黑色砂层下方埋着几枚带王冠刻印的黄铜齿轮毛坯与一袋工匠遗落的试铸银币。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:08)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step2">
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link "夹出钢印模 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 320 or ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<set _sk to ($science or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
你将齿轮毛坯浸入冷却水槽定型，并把约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的试铸银币收进袋中。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_foundry_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
飞溅的滚烫砂粒落在你的手背上，烫出一小片红印，沉重的火钳也震得你双臂发酸。
<<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[夹出钢印模 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "夹出钢印模">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_foundry_mold"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_foundry_mold"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你顺着地面散落的金黄铜屑一路追踪到铸造厂二楼的模具室。木架上整齐摆放着全套用于修复旧钟塔地下机括城的齿轮木模，墙上还钉着一张连通机括城蒸汽压力室的排烟管道图。你把图纸上的阀门编号记在心里，目光落向角落那只挂着重锁的铁皮原料柜。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:08)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开铁皮柜 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开铁皮柜 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开铁皮柜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[探冷却槽暗格 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[探冷却槽暗格 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "探冷却槽暗格">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
模具室角落的铁皮原料柜上了厚重的挂锁，旁边靠着一根六角钢钎。柜门缝隙里隐约可见银白色的金属锭光泽。
<<if $mpClues["grand_foundry_mold"]>><span class="teal">你对照炉渣堆里拾到的残损砂模编号，认出了模具室角落那只上锁的原料柜。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:08)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬开原料柜 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 340>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($physique or 0) gte 9500>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1250>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 950>><<else>><<set _reward to 680>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_foundry_rail"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_foundry_rail"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你用钢钎别开锁扣，取出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的纯银碎锭，并记下柜门内侧通往黑铁信号塔值班室的货运轨道路线。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_foundry_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[转过拐角 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
钢钎在坚硬的锁梁上打滑，刺耳的金属刮擦声在空旷厂房里回荡，累得你双臂发麻。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬开原料柜 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开原料柜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 5)>>
一楼炼铁炉侧面的干涸冷却槽底部嵌着一块厚实的耐火砖盖板，四周残留着白垩记号。盖板下面藏着私铸工匠存放核心母模与货款的耐火金匣。
<<if $mpClues["grand_foundry_rail"]>><span class="teal">顺着窄轨尽头留下的白垩滑痕，你一眼找准了冷却槽底部松动的耐火砖盖板。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:08)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬砖取金匣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestFoundry_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你避开滚烫的余烬掀开盖板，拎出耐火金匣，收好里面的青铜母模与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的货款。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_foundry_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:10)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step6]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
耐火砖边缘残留的高温烫伤了你的指尖，厂房大门外忽然传来工匠返回开锁的动静。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬砖取金匣 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬砖取金匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to Math.max(($mpQuestFoundry or 0), 6)>>
你把铁皮柜与冷却槽盖板恢复原状，推开铸造厂后侧的排渣小门走到露天栈道上。一名替<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>看守货场的水手正提着风灯站在墙角，见你出来便朝小巷方向做了个安全的手势：「私铸工匠刚从正门进去，顺着这排废铁桶往外走，没人能瞧见你。」夜风吹散了你身上的炭火热气。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:10)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[避炭灰撤离 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Foundry Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestFoundry to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestFoundry to 1>>
你避开旧铸造厂地面残留的暗红炭灰，将从熔炉冷却槽暗格里取出的耐火金匣收入行囊。工业区小巷尽头的货运卡车正准备发车。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工业区小巷 (0:10)|Industrial Alleyways]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-resolve">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<sneakicon>><<link "走侧门离开 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-foundry-resolve">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 330 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestFoundry_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你趁卡车发动的轰鸣声穿出厂区，将多余的银锭兑成约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的现钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_foundry_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前进 (0:10)|MP Grand Quest Foundry]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
沉重的金匣坠得你步履蹒跚，好不容易拐出巷口时已经累得直喘粗气。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Foundry Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[走侧门离开 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "走侧门离开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 1)>>
你走到孤儿院花园最僻静的角落，拨开层层叠叠的常春藤，露出了那口早已被木盖封住的石砌枯井。挪开朽坏的木盖向下望去，枯井早已干涸，井壁上每隔两尺便嵌着一枚结实的生锈铁脚蹬。你可以顺着铁脚蹬爬下井底，或者先在井口听听地底引水涵洞的风声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:12)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬下枯井 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[探井底涵洞 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step3]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestGardenWell or 0) gte 3>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[取避难铁匣 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step4]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 2)>>
你双手抓紧嵌入石壁的铁脚蹬，一步步向下爬进幽暗干爽的枯井底部。井底铺着厚厚的细沙，沙层里散落着早年院童投下的许愿硬币。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:08)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step2">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<investigateicon>><<link "摸涵洞口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你稳稳落在细沙上，从井壁石缝里拢起一捧保存完好的早期银币，折算约有 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_garden_well_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
倒数第二根铁脚蹬突然松动下沉，你脚下一空跌坐在沙地上，手掌被铁锈磨破了一块皮。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[摸涵洞口 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸涵洞口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["abbey_steps"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_well_culvert"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_well_culvert"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
井底侧面的石壁上有一道被青砖半封住的早期引水涵洞，你动手搬开松动的砖块钻了进去。拱形涵洞内部十分干燥，砖壁上刻着百年前修道院工匠留下的路标，指明顺着涵洞南端就能直通地下古修道院的静默石阶。涵洞中央的石台上端放着一只首任院长留下的避难铁匣。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:08)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[开院长避难匣 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[开院长避难匣 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "开院长避难匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[找古董银饰 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[找古董银饰 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "找古董银饰">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你蹲在干燥的涵洞石台前，用指尖拨开避难铁匣生满绿锈的铜搭扣。铁匣里面整齐叠放着一份羊皮纸书写的早期院产地契抄本与一封火漆应急金信封。
<<if $mpClues["grand_well_culvert"]>><span class="teal">凭着井壁铁梯背面的刻痕指引，你在干燥涵洞的石台下摸到了那只避难铁匣。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:08)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "打开铁匣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($history or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_well_deed"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_well_deed"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你读懂地契上注明正本存于古修道院灰烬藏经阁，并取出信封里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的院童救济金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_garden_well_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
褪色的古体字迹在昏暗光线下难以辨认，涵洞里的冷气冻得你鼻尖发酸。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[打开铁匣 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "打开铁匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 5)>>
避难铁匣底部设有一块带暗簧的防潮锡板，四角用细铜钉固定。锡板下面封存着首任院长留给院童在危急关头变现自救的古董银饰与金壳怀表。
<<if $mpClues["grand_well_deed"]>><span class="teal">对照早期院产地契抄本末尾的附图，你看出了铁匣底层防潮锡板的开启暗簧。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:08)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<sneakicon>><<link "起出细铜钉 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestGardenWell_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你顺着锡板边缘轻轻一挑便打开暗格，收好古董银饰与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的金镑硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_garden_well_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
锡板边缘锈得锋利如刀，划破了你的食指，涵洞顶部的碎石簌簌落下吓了你一跳。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[起出细铜钉 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "起出细铜钉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to Math.max(($mpQuestGardenWell or 0), 6)>>
你在涵洞北壁上方发现了一道直通孤儿院一楼旧储物室的方形通气孔，将两边的地下脉络彻底印证。正当你走到井底准备往上爬时，井口探出<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>>凯拉尔<<else>>角落的学生<</if>>的身影，默默垂下一根结实的园艺麻绳：「我见常春藤动过就守在这里替你看着，没人往花园这边来。」借着麻绳的拉力，你省力不少。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:08)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀回地面 (0:12)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Garden Well Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGardenWell to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestGardenWell to 1>>
你攀着孤儿院花园枯井内壁的铁脚蹬回到地面，拨过浓密的常春藤将井口重新掩好。微风拂过菜畦，首任院长留下的早期地契与古董银饰已尽数归你所有。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院花园 (0:12)|Garden]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-resolve">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<mprepairicon>><<link "掩好井口 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-garden-well-resolve">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 320 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestGardenWell_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你仔细拂去裤脚的沙土，将部分银币分装妥当，折算下来足有约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_garden_well_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[趁势追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
攀爬枯井耗尽了你的力气，回到草坪时小腿还在微微打颤。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Garden Well Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[掩好井口 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "掩好井口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 1)>>
趁着浴室里空无一人，你走到最里侧的黄铜热水管旁，伸手轻轻挪开了那块早已松动的白瓷砖。瓷砖后方是一个干燥的壁内空腔，里面塞着一只用防水蜡布包裹的扁平铜盒，深处还能看见控制整栋楼热水循环的副阀门。你可以先取出扁平铜盒，或者仔细查看副阀门上的刻字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院浴室 (0:08)|Bathroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[取出铜盒 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[请罗宾望风 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">请罗宾望风 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestBathPipe or 0) gte 3>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[微调副阀 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 2)>>
由于黄铜热水管常年散发着高热，壁内空腔边缘十分烫手。你将毛巾缠在手腕上，探指去勾那只被防水蜡布包裹的扁平铜盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院浴室 (0:08)|Bathroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mplockpickicon>><<link "勾出热水铜盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1050>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 800>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
你灵巧地避开滚烫管壁抽出铜盒，拨开盒扣摸出前人藏匿的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 私房硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_bath_pipe_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[找罗宾说话 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找罗宾说话 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[按刻字调副阀 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的手背不小心贴在了滚烫的铜管接头上，烫得你倒吸一口凉气，差点把瓷砖摔在地上。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mplockpickicon>><<link [[勾出热水铜盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "勾出热水铜盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_bath_note"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_bath_note"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正抱着换洗衣物守在浴室半掩的木门边替你留意走廊动静。看见你打开铜盒露出一小瓶淡金色香精油，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>凑近闻了闻：「这种带着迷迭香与柑橘味的精油，只有多瑙河温室庄园的玻璃穹顶露台才会调配。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>指了指铜盒底部刻着的一行小字，上面记着调节热水副阀门的圈数。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院浴室 (0:08)|Bathroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[微调热水副阀 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[微调热水副阀 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "微调热水副阀">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[探夹墙暗槽 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step5]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[探夹墙暗槽 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "探夹墙暗槽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你按照铜盒底部刻着的小字提示，伸手握住热水管后方的黄铜副阀门。你屏住呼吸先向左旋半圈再向右回四分之一圈，细致地调节着管道内的蒸汽回流压力。
<<if $mpClues["grand_bath_note"]>><span class="teal">你按更衣柜底铜盒上刻着的旋阀圈数，稳稳握住了热水管后方的黄铜副阀。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院浴室 (0:08)|Bathroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<investigateicon>><<link "旋副阀排水 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($science or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_bath_valve"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_bath_valve"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
管道内传出轻柔的排气声，不仅让水温变得均匀柔和，还从与机括城蒸汽压力室相连的回水匣里冲出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的旧币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_bath_pipe_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你旋错了方向，管道里发出一阵剧烈的咕噜声，吓得你一身冷汗连忙拧回原位。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[旋副阀排水 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "旋副阀排水">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 5)>>
随着回水匣里的积水彻底排空，夹墙最深处的方形铅皮暗槽完全露了出来。暗槽干燥的隔板上放着一只雕花古董银皂盒与一卷防潮纸钞。
<<if $mpClues["grand_bath_valve"]>><span class="teal">趁着副阀门将回水匣积水彻底排空，夹墙深处的方形铅皮暗槽已是一览无余。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院浴室 (0:08)|Bathroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<bedicon "zzz">><<link "滴精油舒缓 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-bath-pipe-step5">>
