<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你用毛巾垫着指尖夹出那只古董银皂盒，收好里面约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的私房钞票。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_bath_pipe_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
铅皮暗槽边缘的毛刺刮伤了你的手背，走廊外突然传来院童跑向浴室的脚步声。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[滴精油舒缓 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "滴精油舒缓">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Bath Pipe Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestBathPipe to Math.max(($mpQuestBathPipe or 0), 6)>>
你在温热的铜管表面滴了一小滴刚找到的高级香精油，清幽的迷迭香与白花气息顿时随着氤氲的水雾在浴室里弥漫开来。深吸一口温暖湿润的空气，你紧绷的肩颈与酸楚的四肢都舒展开来。你将空铜盒放回夹墙深处，拿过干帕子准备把松动的白瓷砖重新按紧。
