<<mpswimicon>><<link [[潜水采贝 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link [[观察潮汐 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[观察潮汐 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "观察潮汐">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0) gte 3>>
	<<mpsewicon>><<link [[探岩缝沉沙匣 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGrottoPearl to Math.max(($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0), 2)>>
你站在潭边深吸一口气，顺着光滑的潭壁潜入清澈微凉的水下。幽蓝的磷光在四周浮动，你拨开摇曳的墨绿海藻，伸手去撬附着在岩缝间的夜光珠贝。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
