<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_grotto_pearl_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看水道 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再潜摸铜盒 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
冰冷的潭水冻得你小腿抽筋，手指在锋利的礁石边缘划出一道血口，只得浮出水面喘气。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<swimicon>><<link [[潜潭摸暗道 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "潜潭摸暗道">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGrottoPearl to Math.max(($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_grotto_tide"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_grotto_tide"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你坐在潭边高出水面的干燥平石台上，静静倾听潭底岩洞传来的共鸣水声。每当外海退潮，潭水就会顺着北侧一道天然石拱流向雾角灯塔岛下方的海蚀回音廊。借着水位下降一尺的空档，你清楚地看到潭底最深处的沉沙里露出一角青铜首饰盒的绿锈。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<swimicon>><<link [[潭底捞铜盒 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[取海蓝宝链 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[取海蓝宝链 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取海蓝宝链">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestGrottoPearl to Math.max(($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你趁着难得的平潮期再次潜入潭底最深处，水压让耳膜微微发紧。你双手扒开覆盖在岩缝底部的细密白沙，抱住那只沉甸甸的古代青铜首饰盒往上托举。
<<if $mpClues["grand_grotto_tide"]>><span class="teal">你算准岩壁刻痕所示的平潮间隙潜入潭底，水下暗流的推力果然小了大半。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-grotto-pearl-step4">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<swimicon>><<link "扒沙起首饰盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-grotto-pearl-step4">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 340>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($swimmingskill or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>>
你双腿有力地蹬水浮上石台，在盒底防水夹板里发现通往修道院暗河渡口的水路图与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古金币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_grotto_pearl_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
沉重的青铜盒让你在水下耗尽了气息，不得不松手先游回岸边大口喘气。
<<tiredness 4>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<swimicon>><<link [[扒沙起首饰盒 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "扒沙起首饰盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestGrottoPearl to Math.max(($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你将打捞上来的青铜首饰盒放在干石台上，用衣角擦去表面的泥沙。盒盖四周用陈年蜂蜡与倒刺铜扣封得严严实实，需要顺着锁槽纹路小心撬开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:03)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-grotto-pearl-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<bedicon "zzz">><<link "静坐调息 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-grotto-pearl-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_grotto_pearl"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_grotto_pearl"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestGrottoPearl_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
盒盖应声弹开，幽蓝磷光映亮了一串海蓝宝石古董项链与盒底约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的珍珠母币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_grotto_pearl_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[深入查看 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
铜扣上的绿锈倒刺扎破了你的指腹，冰冷的潮水漫上石台脚边，催得你心神不宁。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[静坐调息 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "静坐调息">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestGrottoPearl to Math.max(($mpQuestGrottoPearl or 0), 6)>>
你坐在干燥的平石台上，看着手中晶莹剔透的海蓝宝石项链与夜光珠贝在幽暗中散发柔和的蓝光。潮汐水潭平静如镜，洞顶水珠滴落的清脆声响仿佛能洗去脑海中的一切杂念，让你在幽暗海洞中生出的紧张感消散无踪。你将项链与珠贝妥善装进贴身皮袋，准备顺着退潮浅滩离开。
<<stress -4>><<trauma -1>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_grotto_pearl"]>><span class="teal">掌心的夜光珠贝与先前在浅洞记下的潮汐波纹遥相呼应，令你心神格外安定。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpswimicon>><<link [[涉水上岸 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Grotto Pearl Resolve]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 5>><</link>>

