</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 1)>>
你穿过深林浓重的迷雾，踏上古树环绕的月牙形石台，石台表面覆满柔软的绿苔，中央凿着一道弯月形的浅槽。四周的高大冷杉遮蔽了天光，空气里浮动着松脂与冷泉的清冽气息。你可以俯身拂去弯月浅槽里的落叶，或者先向提灯巡林的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>请教古德鲁伊仪轨。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<investigateicon>><<link [[清理月槽落叶 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step2]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">清理月槽落叶 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[问阿什 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step3]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问阿什 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问阿什 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 3>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>	<<sneakicon>><<link [[引泉水入槽 (0:06)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step4]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">引泉水入槽 (0:06)（此时不便行动）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 2)>>
你俯身跪在柔软的绿苔上，小心拨开弯月形浅槽里的松针与刺藤。槽底花岗岩上刻着古德鲁伊用来观测雾月潮汐的精密星宿图。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step2">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<mpfarmicon>><<link "清月槽针刺藤 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step2">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($tending or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($tending or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你将二十八宿凹槽清理干净，并从主星凹坑里抠出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古代奉纳银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_moon_altar_step2_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>><<link [[问阿什机关 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问阿什机关 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[引露水入槽 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
腐叶底下藏着的荆棘刺伤了你的指尖，林间骤起的寒风吹得你打了个哆嗦。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<mpfarmicon>><<link [[清月槽针刺藤 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "清月槽针刺藤">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 3)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_moon_star"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_moon_star"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
提着黄铜防风灯的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>正带着猎犬停在石台下方的树根旁，见你清理完星宿槽，便走上台阶递给你一截中空竹管。「这座月牙台靠水力平衡锤控制，把北侧冷泉的水引到月牙尖端，背面树根里的石匣就会滑开。」<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守灯人<</if>>抬手指向密林深处，「顺着这道泉眼往里走，还能到达古德鲁伊石环的月泉祭坛。」
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[引泉水入槽 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step4]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<sneakicon>><<link [[挖树根取匣 (0:07)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step5]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[挖树根取匣 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挖树根取匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 4)>><<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你用竹管将石台北侧的清泉细流引入弯月浅槽，清凉的水花在青苔间溅开。清澈的露水沿着星宿连线缓缓流向月牙尖端，石台下方顿时传来低沉的配重锤滑动声。
<<if $mpClues["grand_moon_star"]>><span class="teal">你对照石环外围拓下的星宿方位，将竹管精准引向了石台北侧的弯月浅槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step4">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<investigateicon>><<link "引泉注月槽 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step4">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['grand_moon_star'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300 or ($tending or 0) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($willpower or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>
水流精准注满月尖凹池，石台背面弹出一道通往古根地穴的路标牌与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的祭礼银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_moon_altar_step4_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循迹深入 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step5]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
竹管接口频频漏水，冰凉的泉水浸湿了你的袖口，试了好几次才勉强蓄满浅槽。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[引泉注月槽 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "引泉注月槽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 5)>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
石台背面的苍白古树根须交错缠绕，一方雕刻着鹿角的青石匣刚从暗槽里滑出一半。你需要赶在平衡锤水漏排空合拢前，将石匣里面的圣物稳妥取出来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step5">
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 280>><<bedicon "zzz">><<link "听风调息 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-step5">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 330>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["grand_moon_stag"]>><<set $mpClues["grand_moon_stag"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestMoonAltar_stg_5")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你眼疾手快地探手取出纯银月鹿雕像、千年琥珀标本与约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古金币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_moon_altar_step5_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[循线追查 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
平衡锤水漏排空，沉重的石匣盖猛地回弹夹痛了你的手背，惊起林冠一群夜鸦。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[听风调息 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "听风调息">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Step6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to Math.max(($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0), 6)>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>
林风吹过古树树冠，松涛声仿佛在向你低语着这片古老森林最悠久的祝福，令你的心神与意志都变得无比澄明。随着周围的浓雾散开一线，你抬头看见高处树冠分叉间隐约露出的守林人瞭望台木栏。你将纯银月鹿雕像与琥珀标本贴身收好，向着月牙石台微微颔首。
<<stress -4>><<willpower 1>>
<<if $mpClues["grand_moon_stag"]>><span class="teal">石台暗格里白鹿雕像的朝向与先前引泉点亮的星槽连成一线，指明了林间归路。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[走下石台返回 (0:05)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Resolve]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpQuestMoonAltar to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpQuestMoonAltar to 1>>
你走下深林古树环绕的月牙石台，将石槽暗格里取出的古德鲁伊银徽与草药秘卷贴身收好。林间蜿蜒的石径上正好有一支背着竹篓的采药商队经过。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-resolve">
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 280 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500>><<walkicon>><<link "收银徽下石台 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-grand-quest-moon-altar-resolve">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($athletics or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($willpower or 0), ($athletics or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1180>><<else>><<set _reward to 880>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mpQuestMoonAltar_stg_7")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你稳步穿出迷雾林带，将多余的琥珀标本交予商队换得约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的酬金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("mp_grand_quest_moon_altar_resolve_1_reward")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去下一处 (0:03)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
林间湿滑的苔藓让你差点崴了脚踝，费了不少功夫才走回主路。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Grand Quest Moon Altar Resolve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[收银徽下石台 (0:03)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "收银徽下石台">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：8500">><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
